# AIFS backend deployment configuration.
# Copy to .env and adjust for your deployment. Never commit .env.
#
# Root path of the deployed REST basis set pool. The backend joins this root
# with the requested basis name (basis_path = {AIFS_BASIS_SET_POOL}/{basis}),
# so no machine-local path is ever hardcoded by the backend. Requests cannot
# supply their own pool: the field is not part of the API, and basis names
# that are absolute or contain '.'/'..' segments are rejected (HTTP 422,
# code "basis_outside_pool"). Leaving this unset makes POST /v1/rest-inputs
# return HTTP 500 (code "configuration_error"), never a rendered card.
AIFS_BASIS_SET_POOL=/path/to/rest/basis_sets
